# slug: ch49-refine
# source: chapters/ch49.tex:191
# label: alg:ch49-refine
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch49.tex:194
# caption: Refine a complete token DFA until transition signatures agree within blocks.

REQUIRE reachable complete DFA, alphabet classes, token output per state
ENSURE quotient DFA preserving every future output
partition states by current token output, including none
REPEAT
  remember the current partition P
  FORALL blocks B of P DO
    group states in B by the vector of successor block identifiers
    replace B by those nonempty groups
  END FOR
UNTIL no block was split
emit one quotient state per block, with its common output and transitions

